)
allowances under section 19, 19A, 20, 21, 22 or 23 or losses or donations allowable under section 37 may be deducted against any part of the income of the insurer from a participating fund that is apportioned to policyholders in accordance with regulations made under section 43(9) or 43C if, and only if, the allowances, losses or donations are —
(i)
allowances, losses or donations in respect of such income; or
