(ii)
did not show any sign of life at any time after being completely expelled from the mother;
(
b
)
a child that —
(i)
has issued from the child’s mother after the twenty-second week of pregnancy and on or after 29 May 2022 but before the date of commencement of section 2(
c
) of the Stillbirths and Births (Miscellaneous Amendments) Act 2024; and
(ii)
did not show any sign of life at any time after being completely expelled or extracted from the mother; or
(
c
)
